Security and Privacy Requirements

The AI Security Copilot™ must be built with security and privacy by design. It must enforce strict tenant isolation, role-based access control, least-privilege access, comprehensive audit logging, prompt injection protection, encrypted communications, and zero cross-tenant data exposure. All responses must be generated exclusively from the authenticated user's authorized data, ensuring confidentiality, integrity, regulatory compliance, and enterprise-grade trust suitable for financial institutions, government agencies, healthcare organizations, and other highly regulated industries.